{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|Cutthroat $Knuckles}}

The '''Cutthroat Knuckles''' use the glove slot, give bonus unarmed damage, and are created from 2 bars of [[Bronze]], [[Bar of Cast Iron|Iron]] or [[Bar of Steel|Steel]]. 

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{{_{q}Hard Metal} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>.
* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 5*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Knucles}/10}</math>.